# ctrl-s. (Ari's room) — "00. * Assets/" above already keeps the whole folder
# local, but style.md is the room's committed style law, so re-include the
# folder and explicitly ignore the private parts (source photos + candidates).
!00. Ctrl-S Assets/
00. Ctrl-S Assets/sources/
00. Ctrl-S Assets/out/
